  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/features/info.css" />
  <script src="/lib/MobileNavHandler.js" defer></script>
  <%- include('./partials/icons') %>
</head>
<%- include('./partials/google') %>

<body>
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container-fluid p-3 info-container">

    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="text-center">Simple Virtual Tabletop With No Player Accounts</h1>
      <p>
        Start playing online in minutes. Far Reach Co. is a lightweight virtual tabletop that runs in any
        browser - your players join by link, no account or install required. It is the fastest way to run a
        tabletop RPG session online.
      </p>
      <hr>
    </div>

    <!-- 1. Invite by Link -->
    <section id="invite-by-link">
      <h2>Invite by Link - No Player Accounts Needed</h2>
      <p>
        Share a single link and your players are in. There is no signup flow, no download, no app store.
        Players open the link in their browser and they are at the table in seconds.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Zero friction for players</strong> - no account creation, no email verification, no waiting.</li>
        <li><strong>You stay in control</strong> - as the GM, you hold the table. Players join and leave freely.</li>
        <li><strong>Works on mobile and desktop</strong> - any device with a modern browser is enough.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. No Installs -->
    <section id="no-installs">
      <h2>No Installs - Runs in Any Browser</h2>
      <p>
        Far Reach Co. is a fully browser-based virtual tabletop. There is nothing to download or install for
        you or your players. It is a simple online tabletop that stays out of the way and lets you focus on
        the game.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Lightweight</strong> - no Electron app, no client download, no system requirements beyond a browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Always up to date</strong> - you get improvements automatically, no update prompts.</li>
        <li><strong>Cross-platform</strong> - Windows, Mac, Linux, iOS, Android - if it has a browser, it works.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Persistent Campaigns -->
    <section id="persistent-campaigns">
      <h2>Persistent Campaigns - Play Long-Term</h2>
      <p>
        For groups going beyond a single session, Wyrlds give you a full campaign workspace that persists
        between sessions. Maps, tokens, records, character sheets, and notes all stay exactly where you
        left them.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Multiple tables</strong> - link dungeon rooms, world maps, and encounter areas together with portal pins.</li>
        <li><strong>Campaign records</strong> - write lore, NPC notes, session recaps, and world-building docs in one place.</li>
        <li><strong>Character sheet management</strong> - D&D 5E character sheets linked directly to your Wyrld.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Far Reach Radio -->
    <section id="far-reach-radio">
      <h2>Free Shared Music via Far Reach Radio</h2>
      <p>
        Far Reach Radio streams curated tabletop RPG audio to every player at the table simultaneously -
        no Spotify juggling, no YouTube ads, no second screen. The GM picks a station and everyone hears
        the same music in sync.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Shared listening</strong> - everyone on the table hears the same track at the same time.</li>
        <li><strong>Curated for tabletop RPGs</strong> - atmospheric stations for combat, exploration, taverns, and more.</li>
        <li><strong>Completely free</strong> - no premium tier required to use Far Reach Radio.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section id="get-started">
      <div class="seo-cta-block">
        <p>Ready to run your first session? It takes less than two minutes to set up.</p>
        <a class="seo-cta-primary" href="/register">Create a Free Account</a>
        <a class="seo-cta-secondary" href="/vtt/guest/start">Try the VTT Free - No Signup</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
  <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
